blocks.en:
We apply 14 standard distortions:
JPEG compression with quality 90, 70, 50, 30, 10, and 5;
Gaussian blur with radius 1, 2, 4, 6, and 8 pixels;
and down-scaling by a factor of 0.5, 0.25, and 0.125 followed by up-scaling back to 512 × 512 512\times 512 with bicubic interpolation.
We save all outputs as PNG, so no further compression is added.

blocks.zh:
我们采用14个标准扭曲:
质量为90、70、50、30、10和5的JPEG压缩;
高斯模糊度与半径1,2,4,6和8像素;
并用0.5分,0.25分和0.125分的系数来缩放,然后用双相插值将缩放回512×512 512\时的512分.
我们把所有输出都保存为PNG,所以没有添加进一步的压缩.
